# -- Nested Unity projects: regenerable caches -------------------------------
# The rules above are anchored to this project's root (e.g. "/[Ll]ibrary/"),
# so a nested Unity project keeps its own cache in the backup. The same names
# inside any sub-project are just as regenerable as they are here.
**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/

# -- Vendored upstream clones: contents intentionally not duplicated ---------
# Each path below is a pristine clone of a public GitHub repo (some are also
# partial clones). Their file contents are deliberately left out of this repo
# to avoid duplicating ~1.5 GB of upstream data. Every one is reproducible:
# the exact origin URL, branch and commit are recorded in VENDORED-UPSTREAMS.md
# (git clone <url> && git checkout <sha>).
/Tools/BPRebooted/upstream/bp-rebooted/
/Tools/BPRebooted/upstream/bp-rebooted-delta/
/Tools/BPRebooted/upstream/BPLE-2022.1/
/Tools/BPRebooted/upstream/BPLE-2022.1.9/
/Tools/Jolt/JoltPhysicsC/
/Tools/StarSea/upstream/
/_codex_work/DivisionUI/
/_codex_work/idc/UnityIngameDebugConsole/

